msgstr ""
"La dirección pública no es HTTPS: Entra ID solo acepta direcciones de vuelta HTTPS y las "
"contraseñas viajan sin cifrar."

#: storageweb/core/network.py
msgid ""
"The session cookie is HTTPS-only but the application sees this request as HTTP: the proxy "
